        "created_at": "2016-04-26T23:32:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here comes a new challenge. This one is simple, just do a random adance game and post your results with your favorite move that was done that game (if there is one). Then, update the totals on the bottom.</p><p>I'll start:</p><p>Advance Akush'bhuta VS Chrono-Ranger, Tachyon, Dark Watch Nightmist, &amp; Omnitron-X IN Ruins of Atlantis</p><p>Outcome:&nbsp;Close game, but we lost</p><p>While the -1 damage was annoying, the game wasn't so bad. Things went down-hill when a fully setup Omnitron-X took 5 damage to wipe his board. HIs plating that stops melee and projectile was incredibly useful, but was hit for 5 when the environment played Entomb. Everyone but Omnitron-X went down, and he lasted awhile, but Omnitron-X kept getting hit with the Ensnaring Brambles and he couldn't deal damage. Lasted a while, but it finally went down.</p><p>Favorite Move: Used Electro Deployment Unit to have Omnitron-X play Slip Through Time and Elemental Exochasis on the same turn. For a power, I discarded a plating for Defensive Blast, which allowed me to deal 4 damage to everything instead of three with Elemental Exochasis. Then, Slipped Through Time allowed me to play Ablative Coating after the power, so I was still protected from melee and projectile.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>-------</p><p><strong>Crushing Defeat: 0</strong></p><p><strong>Close game, but we lost: 1</strong></p><p><strong>Close game, but we won: 0</strong></p><p><strong>Overwhelming Victory: 0</strong></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
