        "cooked": "<p>Kaagra Warfang vs. Golem Unity, Chrono-Ranger,&nbsp;<span>Fanatic at Enclave.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Lost pretty badly (8 - 21). &nbsp;Did pull off one pretty epic move though where Chrono dealt out of turn damage on Kaagra with By Any Means and Ultimate Target on her to reduce her to 0 Hp. &nbsp;She bounced back to 6 HP Dealt each villian target damage ending with herself from mindbreaker and than KO'd herself with Death-Caller so no hero targets were damaged.</span></p>",
