        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Advanced Grand Warlord Voss vs GI Bunker, Skyscrapper, Termination Absolute Zero, Termination Untiy in Pike Industrial Complex</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Close victory or close loss (I retconned an incap action I made once I saw the environment card that came out, so not mint)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Everyone had their moment (though AZs were mostly after he was incapped). AZ fell early getting neither module, or any decent damage dealing card out and getting picked on by lowest/all target minions, plus multiple ill timed vat explosions. He did use Subzero Atmosphere to save us from the first forced deployment. Once incapped reduce all damage but cold by one was a life saver. Skyscrapper went down next tanking most of the damage from the third forced deployment (boosted by the +Damage Vat) leaving Bunker and Unity at 3 health each, no golems out, and Voss at 18 with 14 minions plus the flagship out.</p><p>Bunker was in turret mode so he made damage to Voss irreducible and launched a grenade, Voss at 14 and only botless Unity left. Fortunately both incapped heroes allow for card plays with three card plays (four since one play was swift bot) Unity was able to pull three bots together while augmenting Bunker&#39;s grenade launcher for just enough damage to win the game. I&#39;m sure I did things wrong but it was a blast to play. Thanks for the challange.</p><p>Comic Story Moment: Skyscrapper gives the &quot;Go on without me, I&#39;ll hold them off&quot; speach buying Unity and a Bunker from the past just enough time for a stealth mission to assassinate Voss, thus saving the multiverse... this time.</p>",
